 "remarks": "This bright and sunny 3 bedroom unit with knockout newly gut renovated kitchen and primary bedroom with brand new en suite bathroom and closets is a dream! The front to back entry invites you into the open concept living & dining which are bathed in natural light . The gorgeous custom kitchen with all new St. Martin cabinetry, quartz countertops, stainless appliances and custom lighting is a show stopper. Upgrades such as installing & refinishing hardwood floors, all new recessed lighting, new hardware throughout, & new Nest thermostat system - to name but a few - contribute to the ease of living in this fabulous townhouse. The huge family room with fireplace & an office alcove, which walks out to a serene & sunny deck overlooking conservation land, can't be beat. Come see for yourself!",
